00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:15.670
Someone

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:38.150
<b>I like it when a cold dawn breaks on your complacent expression</b>

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:38.860
<b>I can see your real personality and feelings</b>

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:44.070
<b>I can see your real personality and feelings</b>

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:50.450
<b>in the sky like a promise of things to come</b>

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:56.330
<b>Don't be so mean to me</b>

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:02.130
<b>I felt I saw a smile at the corners of your mouth</b>

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:07.890
<b>and chased its fleeting remnants</b>

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:13.810
<b>without knowing what I was doing</b>

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:22.190
<b>So many things around me are beyond my influence</b>

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:25.440
<b>and I will hold them as tight as I can</b>

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:33.870
<b>We dance a clumsy and slow dance that provides no safety</b>

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:37.080
<b>and give our feelings a shape</b>

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:39.210
<b>and give our feelings a shape</b>

